From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 22:17:28 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Fill soil pH gaps: keep latest non-null value per
 property, widen WoSIS search when a property is missing

- stg_soil: one row per city; each soil property takes its most recent non-null value across fetches
- fetch_soil: widen the search box when any property (e.g. pH) is missing, take each property from the closest box that has it
- ml/utils/db: marts schema configurable via PLANTING_MARTS_SCHEMA
- tests for the soil fetch widening and the schema setting

